\pard\sa120\sb120\fs32\b Set-MaintenanceMode\b0{\*\bkmkstart set-maintenancemode}{\*\bkmkend set-maintenancemode}\par
\pard\sa120\sb120\fs28\b Description\b0{\*\bkmkstart description}{\*\bkmkend description}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Orchestrates maintenance-mode operations across SCOM 2015 and HPE OpenView for a logical cluster defined in clusters_catalogue.json. Supports immediate enable/disable as well as scheduled windows with automatic disable via Windows Task Scheduler. Integrates with OpsRamp for metric/alert emission and can send email notifications. The function is the PowerShell implementation. All datetime values are UTC only. Local time conversion is not performed.\par
