2\sa40\sb40 Directory containing configuration files (default: 'configs').\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -Start\f0}\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Maintenance start datetime (UTC only). Supported formats: - 'now': Current UTC time (default for enable action) - Relative offset: '+Xhours', '+Xminutes', '+Xdays', '+Xseconds' Examples: '+1hour', '+30minutes', '+2days', '+3600seconds' - Absolute UTC: 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM' or 'YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS' Examples: '2026-06-11 22:00', '2026-06-11T22:00:00' IMPORTANT: All times are UTC. No local timezone conversion is performed.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -End\f0}\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Maintenance end datetime (UTC only). Same formats as Start. Required for 'enable' action. Examples: '+2hours', '2026-06-12 02:00', '2026-06-12T02:00:00'\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -DryRun\f0} _(Aliases: -Dry)_\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Simulate without making changes. Shows what would happen.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -MockMaintenanceState\f0} _(Aliases: -MockState)_\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Dry-run only: mock validate status as 'enable', 'disable', or 'partial'. Default is 'disable'.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs